msgstr "Errore bat gertatu da kamera hautatzen"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Hautatutako kamera ezin da ireki"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Saiatu beste bat hautatzen"

#: src/onboarding.py:639
msgid ""
"Please visit\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-em"
"itter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nto en"
"able your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Mesedez, bisitatu\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-"
"ir-emitter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"zure ir igorlea gaitzeko"

#: src/onboarding.py:704
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Konfigurazioa argiztapena 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Konfigurazioa argiztapena 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:723
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ezin da aurpegiaren eredua gorde"

#: src/onboarding.py:728 src/onboarding.py:775
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Eskaneatu bigarren eredua"

#: src/onboarding.py:734
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ezin izan da bigarren eredua grabatu"

#: src/onboarding.py:735
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must "
"still be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than"
" turning it off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from S"
"ettings."
msgstr ""
"Zure lehen eredua gordeta dago, beraz, aurpegiko saioa hasteko jada fu"
"ntzionatzen du. Gelak nahikoa argia izan behar du zure aurpegia ikuste"
"ko, aldatu argia itzali beharrean, eta saiatu berriro, edo saltatu eta"
" gehitu eredu bat geroago Ezarpenak atalean."

#: src/onboarding.py:769
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Bigarren eskaneamendua: argiztapen ezberdina"

#: src/onboarding.py:771
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on o"
"r off, move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep y"
"our face clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Lehen eredua gorde da. Orain aldatu argia (adibidez, piztu edo itzali "
"lanpara bat, urrundu leihotik edo erabili beste gelako argia), mantend"
"u aurpegia argi eta garbi eta sakatu berriro Eskaneatu."

#: src/onboarding.py:805
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello konfigurazioa"

#: src/onboarding.py:818
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> TPM h"
"ardwarea eta tresnak egiaztatzen..."

#: src/onboarding.py:838
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> TPM h"
"ardwarea detektatu da. <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatikoki instalatzen..."

#: src/onboarding.py:850
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> Hardw"
"are TPM 2.0 aktiboa. Zure pasahitza modu seguruan itxiko da TPM barrua"
"n."

#: src/onboarding.py:852
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> TPM h"
"ardwarea detektatu da, baina <i>tpm2-tools</i>ren instalazio automatik"
"oak huts egin du. Exekutatu <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Softwarean oinarritutako kredentzialen cachean itzultzea."

#: src/onboarding.py:854
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure {} aurpegiko autenti"
"fikazioa erabiliz (hautsitako zorroa: {}).\n\n<b>TPM egoera:</b> ez da"
" detektatu TPM hardwarerik. Softwarean oinarritutako kredentzialen cac"
"hea erabiliz (AES-256-GCM)."

