#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Aurpegi-eredu bakarra dago matrikulatuta. Argiak zure aurpegia kamerar"
"en itxura aldatzen du; beraz, modelo bakar batek huts egin dezake arra"
"tsaldean lanpararen azpian (edo egun argian). Gehitu argi ezberdinetan"
" grabatutako bigarren modelo bat desblokeatzea fidagarria izateko egun"
"eko edozein unetan."

